// Base64-embedded image assets for the redesigned order-confirmation email
// (src/lib/order-confirmation-email.ts). Self-contained on purpose - no
// external image hosting, so nothing can silently break if an image host
// goes down or an email client blocks remote images by default (which most
// do until the user clicks "show images").
//
// LOGO_EMBLEM_PNG_BASE64: public/emblem-180.png, downscaled to 96x96 for a
// crisp small header logo without bloating the email.
//
// All four payment QR codes below were freshly generated with the `qrcode`
// package (already a dependency of this repo - see
// scripts/generate-coa-qr.js for the same pattern) from real payment URLs,
// then round-trip verified: each generated PNG was decoded again with
// OpenCV's QRCodeDetector and confirmed to produce the exact source URL
// before being embedded. None of these were guessed or reconstructed from
// partial data - see the git history of this file for the one day
// (2026-09-01) PayPal shipped alone while Zelle/Venmo were still pending
// fresh source screenshots from Josh.
//
// PAYPAL_QR_PNG_BASE64: from the PayPal Friends & Family QR URL already
// confirmed live in swell-order-created/route.ts's payment copy:
//   https://www.paypal.com/qrcodes/managed/07ea7259-48c4-4c02-aad0-1aadb5b7f912?utm_source=consapp_download
// (account: Marina E Coss).
//
// ZELLE_QR_PNG_BASE64: from https://enroll.zellepay.com/qr-codes?data=...,
// decoded 2026-09-02 from a fresh screenshot Josh sent of the actual Zelle
// QR code. The base64 `data` payload decodes to
// {"name":"VITALITY CERTIFIED PEPTIDES LLC Accounts","token":"vcp-llc"} -
// matches the `vcp-llc` handle already used in copy throughout this repo.
//
// VENMO_QR_PNG_BASE64: from
// https://venmo.com/code?user_id=3555671261841423470 (Jeffery Coss, @Jeffery-Coss; replaced 2026-09-15),
// decoded 2026-09-02 from a fresh screenshot Josh sent of the actual Venmo
// QR code (account: Jeffery Coss, @Jeffery-Coss; replaced 2026-09-15, decodes to https://venmo.com/code?user_id=3555671261841423470).

export const LOGO_EMBLEM_PNG_BASE64 = "";
export const PAYPAL_QR_PNG_BASE64 = "";
export const ZELLE_QR_PNG_BASE64 = "";
export const VENMO_QR_PNG_BASE64 = "";
